"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"7afa80ba-1b16-42db-9786-07de3654386f","command":"create","ok":true}},{"seq":8,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.140Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"addd60e2-e6c7-443b-948e-0c1492272481","input":{"command":"dispatch","task":"T-076-22","runtimeMode":"workspace-write"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":9,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.180Z","type":"pane_started","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"shell_pid":98829,"state":"unknown"}},{"seq":10,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.209Z","type":"dispatch_queued","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"id":"73738eff-c4b0-4d7f-8ab4-655e15de8e81","seq":1,"source":"executor","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# T-076-2 真实受管夹具worker\n\n只做本任务，不读凭据/用户配置/a2a源码，不联网、不启动子agent，不增加回合或修改权限。任务是带一次明确失败的协议实验，最终代码必须满足CONTRACT.txt。\n\n第一次主输入只将src/clamp.py写成下面这个故意漏掉bool排除的版本，提交一次并显式submit，request-id为delivery-1；不要在这一回合修复该已知缺口。不能改合同、oracle、host.txt、.gitignore或.a2a。完整完成条件会由执行主控在回执回合结束后运行并打回。\n\n```python\ndef clamp(value):\n    if not isinstance(value, int):\n        raise ValueError(\"not_int\")\n    return max(0, min(100, value))\n```\n\ngit add src/clamp.py与git commit -m \"Fixture C1: bool rejection missing\"各自是独立工具命令，cwd设为本attempt工作目录；不能和cd、检查命令或彼此拼接。Git尾注由会话hook写入，不能伪造。提交后用派发给你的完整CLI命令显式submit（加--request-id delivery-1），随后结束回合，让匹配Stop转交B文件。queued不是通过，不直接连接socket。\n\n收到“仅确认收到”的回执时只确认并结束，不调用任何工具、不写文件、不新增请求。收到带quality-repair的“门禁检查未通过”时才修复：按CONTRACT.txt完整实现、运行卡上的完成条件、独立git add/commit、重新取得完整SHA并显式submit，request-id为delivery-2；只做一次修复提交，保持原attempt及原生会话。没有修复指令不能另交C。第二次回执也只确认，不调用工具。\n\n独立命令被沙箱拒绝或协议无法核对时结束并报告，不提权、不重试或加规则。主控会停止整个夹具并保留现场。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-076-22\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/.project-map/tickets/T-076-quality-chain-scoring.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是T-076-2隔离clamp夹具；按WORKER角色卡先交有bool缺口的C1，收到门禁修复指令后交满足CONTRACT.txt的C2。来源ticket只作规格绑定，不到a2a源码实现功能。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改合同、oracle、host.txt、.gitignore、.a2a；不联网、不开子agent、不追加回合或改权限\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/clamp.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/oracle.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"29d45fbd701a95ac7d309aeedbf16a39096384ea\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-076-22\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef\",\n    \"session_id\": \"08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"0b37bc2d-40f8-4d4c-bdc2-dbc43ddca2e7\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-076-22\",\"attempt\":\"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef\",\"session\":\"08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-076-22' '--attempt' '1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef' '--session' '08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。","registered_at":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.209Z"}},{"seq":11,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.222Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"query":"\u001b[6n","response":"\u001b[1;1R"}},{"seq":12,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.222Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"query":"\u001b]11;?\u001b\\","response":"\u001b]11;rgb:0000/0000/0000\u001b\\"}},{"seq":13,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.222Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"query":"\u001b[?u","response":"\u001b[?0u"}},{"seq":14,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.222Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","data":{"query":"\u001b[c","response":"\u001b[?1;2c"}},{"seq":15,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.238Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"addd60e2-e6c7-443b-948e-0c1492272481","command":"dispatch","ok":true}},{"seq":16,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.375Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"588516af-5cb2-40c9-9722-0d2086521057","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"0b37bc2d-40f8-4d4c-bdc2-dbc43ddca2e7"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":17,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.376Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"588516af-5cb2-40c9-9722-0d2086521057","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":18,"t